| Math function spacing, the default convention
|   (note that this affects mainly the left as there is normally a space on the
|   right - the exception being an opening sign of enclosure on the right)
| 1;1 2016-01-11 JES
| 1;2 2016-04-02/jes: provide for no space on right when an opening sign
|     of enclosure follows - insert [idle~rfs] in its place
| states:
| 1 outside [ts] ... [te]
| 2 inside [ts] ... [te] seeking [idle~lfs]
| 3 inside [ts] ... [te] after [idle~lfs] seeking space
| 99 after prefix awaiting root
